      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY MATE THEO (2) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (28.37) behind INTEGRITY MARNA at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Can find winning form. BAREFOOT RAVEN (5) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (28.22) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Should be about the money. INTEGRITY MARNA (3) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 28.27 beating ZIPPING BOGART. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Should be in this for a long way. GOT NO GOGGLES (1) picked up a cheque out of this box most recently - in the mix again.",
